    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7725" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-φεύγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flee up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.4.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, al.: c. acc., <i>fly to,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.5.40
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.3.50
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>retreat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν ἀνείδεον φύσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.7.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a rumour,
				<i>to be lost</i> in tracing, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				25
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
